{
  "name": "Day 51 Solution: AI Workflow Deployment",
  "description": "A webhook-triggered AI agent with explicit input validation and separate success (200) / error (500) response paths via Respond to Webhook nodes.",
  "tags": ["week8", "ai-agents", "deployment"],
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "overview-sticky",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [160, 20],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 51 Solution: AI Workflow Deployment\n\nA production-style deployment pattern: a POST webhook validates a required field before doing any AI work, then returns an explicit 200 success or 500 error response via Respond to Webhook nodes (never the default auto-response).\n\n**Credentials needed to run for real:** OpenAI API key. None needed to test the validation/response logic.\n\nSee DAILY_TASKS/DAY_51_AI_Workflow_Deployment.md for the full task.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "webhook-config-sticky",
      "name": "Webhook Config Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [160, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Webhook settings\n\nSet **Respond** to \"Using Respond to Webhook Node\" in this node's parameters so nothing auto-responds before the AI call finishes. Method is POST, path is `ai-agent-deploy`.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-agent-deploy-webhook",
      "name": "AI Agent Deploy",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [240, 480],
      "parameters": {
        "path": "ai-agent-deploy",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "responseMode": "responseNode"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "validate-required-fields",
      "name": "Validate Required Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [490, 480],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-scenario-notempty",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.scenario }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "build-processed-result",
      "name": "Build Processed Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [740, 360],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "scenario",
              "value": "={{ $json.scenario }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "processing_status",
              "value": "processing"
            },
            {
              "name": "received_at",
              "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-deployment-analysis",
      "name": "AI Deployment Analysis",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [990, 360],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "create",
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are a deployed production AI agent. Respond concisely to the given deployment scenario as if you were live and being tested by a caller."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "={{ 'Deployment scenario: ' + $json.scenario }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3,
          "maxTokens": 300
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "respond-success",
      "name": "Respond Success",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1240, 360],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"status\": \"deployed\", \"workflow\": \"AI Agent Deploy Demo\", \"scenario\": $json.scenario, \"ai_response\": $json.choices[0].message.content } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "build-error-object",
      "name": "Build Error Object",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [740, 620],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "error_type",
              "value": "missing_required_field"
            },
            {
              "name": "error_message",
              "value": "Missing required field: scenario"
            },
            {
              "name": "failed_at",
              "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "respond-error",
      "name": "Respond Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [990, 620],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"status\": \"error\", \"workflow\": \"AI Agent Deploy Demo\", \"message\": $json.error_message } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 500
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "deployment-record-sticky",
      "name": "Deployment Record Template",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1240, 620],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Deployment Record\n\n- **Production URL:** https://<your-n8n-domain>/webhook/ai-agent-deploy (redact before sharing)\n- **Activation date:** fill in when you toggle Active\n- **Rollback plan:** flip the Active toggle off (top-right of the canvas) to immediately stop the production webhook from accepting new requests; the workflow and its history stay intact for later re-activation.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 340
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "AI Agent Deploy": {
      "main": [
        [
          { "node": "Validate Required Fields", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Validate Required Fields": {
      "main": [
        [
          { "node": "Build Processed Result", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
        ],
        [
          { "node": "Build Error Object", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Build Processed Result": {
      "main": [
        [
          { "node": "AI Deployment Analysis", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "AI Deployment Analysis": {
      "main": [
        [
          { "node": "Respond Success", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Build Error Object": {
      "main": [
        [
          { "node": "Respond Error", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {},
  "pinData": {},
  "versionId": "1",
  "id": "day_51_solution"
}
